;. /inspect_grove_draft_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition inspect_grove_draft
  ;= Check the exact compiled Grove revision
    Bind capture to the computed /x output of an observation cell of the draft job, or the raw record of a deliberately frozen inspection. The current source must equal the proposal, and revision, attempted and ready must agree. An old successful preview cannot satisfy a new proposal. Native action receipts are retained separately from the compiled observation.

    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= capture

    ;@ /flow/input proposal
    ;= proposal

    ;@ /flow/input receipts
    ;= receipts

    ;@ /flow/step verified ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/grove_ready
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;@ /flow/bind proposal proposal
    ;@ /flow/bind receipts receipts
    ;= verified

    ;@ /flow/result verified
    ;= Check the exact compiled Grove revision result
